#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:5 52b59d15b396440abb73e2f5529bf626
msgid "ACRO Mode"
msgstr "ACRO 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:7 abe3cb0ae62546e4b7393214379f9a4e
msgid ""
"ACRO (for acrobatic) is a mode for advanced users that provides rate based "
"stabilization with optional attitude lock. It is a good choice for people "
"who want to push their plane harder than you can in :ref:`FLY BY WIRE A "
"(FBWA) <fbwa-mode>` or :ref:`STABILIZE <stabilize-mode>` mode without flying"
" in :ref:`MANUAL <manual-mode>`. This is the mode to use for rolls, loops "
"and other basic aerobatic maneuvers, or if you just want an \"on rails\" "
"manual flying mode."
msgstr ""
"ACRO（特技）模式是一种面向高级用户的模式，提供基于角速率的稳定，并可选配姿态锁定。对于希望比 :ref:`FLY BY WIRE A (FBWA) "
"<fbwa-mode>` 或 :ref:`STABILIZE <stabilize-mode>` 模式更激烈飞行、又不想切换到 :ref:`MANUAL"
" <manual-mode>` 的飞手来说，这是一个好选择。该模式适用于横滚、筋斗及其他基础特技动作，也适合希望获得「轨道式」手动飞行感受的飞手。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:14 85d9147a2100429ea9a40442db078514
msgid ""
"rate stabilization is not enabled by default for the YAW axis. Set "
":ref:`YAW_RATE_ENABLE<YAW_RATE_ENABLE>` = 1 to enable yaw axis rate "
"stabilization. Be careful since this will prevent any turns by aileron alone"
" and require application of rudder also to turn. Also, do not enable this if"
" the plane has no yaw control."
msgstr ""
"偏航轴的角速率稳定默认未启用。将 :ref:`YAW_RATE_ENABLE<YAW_RATE_ENABLE>` = 1 "
"可启用偏航轴角速率稳定。请注意，启用后仅靠副翼将无法完成转弯，还需同时蹬方向舵。另外，如果飞机没有偏航控制面，请勿启用此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:16 c1e82a331b9e4c99bb2e82ffb0d898b1
msgid ""
"To use this mode you need to set up :ref:`ACRO_YAW_RATE<ACRO_YAW_RATE>` (if "
"using yaw rate controller), :ref:`ACRO_ROLL_RATE <ACRO_ROLL_RATE>` and "
":ref:`ACRO_PITCH_RATE <ACRO_PITCH_RATE>`. These default to 180 "
"degrees/second (and 0, ie no limit, for yaw.However, for AUTOTUNE on yaw "
"axis to work, it must be set to a non-zero value. 90 degrees/second is "
"suggested), and control how responsive your plane will be about each axis. "
"It is also necessary to have the plane tuned well (see :ref:`tuning-"
"quickstart`)"
msgstr ""
"要使用此模式，您需要设置 :ref:`ACRO_YAW_RATE<ACRO_YAW_RATE>` "
"（如使用偏航角速率控制器）、:ref:`ACRO_ROLL_RATE <ACRO_ROLL_RATE>` 和 :ref:`ACRO_PITCH_RATE"
" <ACRO_PITCH_RATE>`。这些参数默认为 180 度/秒（偏航为 0，即不限制，但要使偏航轴 AUTOTUNE "
"正常工作，必须设置为非零值，建议 90 度/秒），控制飞机在各轴上的响应速度。同时也需要对飞机进行良好调参（参见 :ref:`tuning-"
"quickstart`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:20 6ebc79feb548489fae1d8857ab5cf297
msgid ""
"When flying in ACRO the aircraft will resist changes to its existing "
"attitude if you have no stick input. So if you roll the plane to a 30 degree"
" bank angle with 10 degrees pitch and then let go of the sticks, the plane "
"should hold that attitude short term. This applies upside down as well, so "
"if you roll the plane upside down and let go of the sticks the plane will "
"try to hold the inverted attitude short term or until you move the sticks "
"again."
msgstr ""
"在 ACRO 模式飞行时，如果没有摇杆输入，飞机会抵抗姿态变化。因此，如果您将飞机横滚至 30 度坡度角和 10 "
"度俯仰角后松开摇杆，飞机会短时间保持该姿态。倒飞也同样适用——将飞机翻转至倒飞状态后松开摇杆，飞机会短时间尝试保持倒飞姿态，直到您再次操纵摇杆。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:27 84cff0808e9049f4b40b843bd53875ce
msgid ""
"the internal controllers will resist attitude changes, but drift due to "
"turbulence or miss-trimming will result in gradual attitude changes. See "
"ACRO MODE ATTITUDE LOCKING section below."
msgstr "内部控制器会抵抗姿态变化，但由于气流扰动或配平不当造成的漂移仍会导致姿态缓慢改变。请参阅下方 ACRO 模式姿态锁定章节。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:29 17d88237f42249a4aa80ea1592c1311c
msgid ""
"When you apply aileron or elevator stick the plane will rotate about that "
"axis (in body frame) at a rate proportional to the amount of stick movement."
" So if you apply half deflection on the aileron stick then the plane will "
"start rolling at half of ``ACRO_ROLL_RATE``."
msgstr ""
"当您推副翼或升降舵摇杆时，飞机会以与摇杆位移成比例的角速率绕该轴旋转（体轴系）。例如，将副翼摇杆推到一半偏转量，飞机将以 "
"``ACRO_ROLL_RATE`` 的一半速率开始横滚。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:34 0cee283c870a4a61a1e49f6b618a8438
msgid ""
"the :ref:`MAN_EXPO_ROLL<MAN_EXPO_ROLL>`, "
":ref:`MAN_EXPO_PITCH<MAN_EXPO_PITCH>`, and "
":ref:`MAN_EXPO_RUDDER<MAN_EXPO_RUDDER>` parameters will apply exponential to"
" the stick inputs, if non-zero, in this mode. This is for users with "
"transmitters which do not provide this function and desire to \"soften\" "
"stick feel around neutral."
msgstr ""
":ref:`MAN_EXPO_ROLL<MAN_EXPO_ROLL>`、:ref:`MAN_EXPO_PITCH<MAN_EXPO_PITCH>` 和 "
":ref:`MAN_EXPO_RUDDER<MAN_EXPO_RUDDER>` "
"参数如果非零，将在此模式下对摇杆输入应用指数曲线。这适用于遥控器不提供此功能且希望在中立位置附近「柔化」摇杆手感的用户。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:36 601b87735b3e418984fc880418febbd5
msgid ""
"So to perform a simple horizontal roll, just start in level flight then hold"
" the aileron stick hard over while leaving the elevator stick alone. The "
"plane will apply elevator correction to try to resist pitch changes while "
"rolling, including applying inverse elevator while inverted. But to exactly "
"hold the pitch attitude during multiple rolls without drift, "
":ref:`ACRO_LOCKING<ACRO_LOCKING>` must be enabled."
msgstr ""
"要完成简单的水平横滚，只需从平飞状态开始，将副翼摇杆推到底并保持，同时不动升降舵摇杆。飞机会施加升降舵修正以抵抗俯仰变化，包括在倒飞时施加反向升降舵。但要在多圈横滚中精确保持俯仰姿态而不发生漂移，必须启用"
" :ref:`ACRO_LOCKING<ACRO_LOCKING>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:42 cddfcf30f6e7494cad6534224b097111
msgid ""
"Performing a loop is just as simple - just start with wings level then pull "
"back on the elevator stick while leaving the aileron alone. The controller "
"will try to hold your roll attitude through the loop. You can stop the loop "
"upside down if you like as part of maneuvers such as Immelman turns or cuban"
" eights."
msgstr ""
"完成筋斗同样简单——从机翼水平状态开始，向后拉升降舵摇杆，同时不动副翼。控制器会尝试在筋斗全程保持您的横滚姿态。您可以在倒飞位置停止筋斗，以配合英麦曼转弯或古巴8字等特技动作。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:48 262b2d311c0740f38c2f009eb0eab7de
msgid ""
"Note that if you are using ACRO mode to try and teach yourself aerobatic "
"flying then it is highly recommended that you setup a :ref:`geo-fence "
"<geofencing>` in case you get disoriented."
msgstr "请注意，如果您使用 ACRO 模式自学特技飞行，强烈建议设置 :ref:`电子围栏 <geofencing>`，以防迷失方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:54 03ea9a2e1edc46ffb816622c2074655b
msgid ""
"It is very easy to stall your plane in ACRO mode, and if you stall you "
"should change to MANUAL mode to recover."
msgstr "在 ACRO 模式下飞机非常容易失速，一旦失速应切换至 MANUAL 模式进行改出。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:57 11f653b2776b44e4b9edd533e7a25b2a
msgid ""
"make sure you know the limitations of your airframe, and what the correct "
"stall recovery procedure is. This varies a lot between airframes. Search for"
" stall recovery tutorials for R/C aircraft and read them"
msgstr "务必了解您所用机型的限制，以及正确的失速改出程序。不同机型的改出方法差异很大。请搜索遥控飞机失速改出教程并仔细阅读。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:61 2e8217687c314b23a108c5cf511b78e1
msgid ""
"don't overload your airframe, only fly ACRO mode with a plane capable of "
"surviving full control surface deflections at any speed."
msgstr "不要超过机型承受能力，只在确保飞机能够承受任意速度下全舵面偏转的情况下，才在 ACRO 模式飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:62 50c32c7f34e34d758359898d6fbeb53c
msgid ""
"make sure you have enough airspeed for whatever maneuver you are attempting."
" Throttle and speed control is completely under manual pilot control in ACRO"
" mode"
msgstr "确保您有足够的空速来完成所尝试的动作。在 ACRO 模式下，油门和速度完全由飞手手动控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:65 f92975dfe82043ec8c4c9ffbf0ebc6fc
msgid ""
"practice stall recovery before trying anything too fancy. Make sure you "
"practice when you have plenty of altitude to give you time to try different "
"recovery strategies"
msgstr "在尝试高难度动作之前先练习失速改出。确保在有充裕高度时练习，以便有时间尝试不同的改出方案。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:69 8c8b5556dd5747b7b87d24b0d9013e44
msgid ""
"It can be a lot of fun flying ACRO mode, but you can also easily stall and "
"crash hard. Automatic stall detection and recovery in autopilots is an area "
"of research, and is not yet implemented in Plane, so if you do stall then "
"recovery is up to you. The best mode for recovery is MANUAL."
msgstr ""
"ACRO 模式飞行非常有趣，但也很容易失速并重摔。飞控中的自动失速检测与改出仍属研究领域，Plane "
"中尚未实现，因此一旦失速，改出完全依赖于飞手。最佳改出模式是 MANUAL。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:75 ea1023657dbb4ee288342508e09c6e73
msgid "ACRO MODE ATTITUDE LOCKING"
msgstr "ACRO 模式姿态锁定"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:77 d9abc21c33e148d7a7b902996489162a
msgid ""
"By enabling the :ref:`ACRO_LOCKING<ACRO_LOCKING>` parameter, whatever "
"attitude (roll and pitch angle) the pilot places the plane in, upon "
"releasing the sticks, the autopilot will not only resist rate changes "
"(caused by trim or turbulence), but also attempt to hold and correct back to"
" that attitude. Note that his requires that the plane be properly tuned (see"
" :ref:`Tuning<common-tuning>` )."
msgstr ""
"通过启用 :ref:`ACRO_LOCKING<ACRO_LOCKING>` "
"参数，无论飞手将飞机置于何种姿态（横滚角和俯仰角），松开摇杆后，飞控不仅会抵抗角速率变化（由配平偏差或气流扰动引起），还会主动保持并修正回该姿态。请注意，这需要飞机经过良好调参（参见"
" :ref:`调参<common-tuning>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:79 ba0bbd6e4e0f49e08c848cfe1a95362e
msgid ""
"It is recommended that it be set to \"2\", instead of \"1\", in order to use"
" a quarternion based control system with much better performance than the "
"older system. In order for this to be effective, yaw rate control "
"(:ref:`YAW_RATE_ENABLE<YAW_RATE_ENABLE>`) must be \"1\" and the yaw rate "
"controller tuned using :ref:`Autotune <automatic-tuning-with-autotune>` for "
"best performance."
msgstr ""
"建议将其设置为「2」而非「1」，以使用基于四元数的控制系统，其性能远优于旧系统。为使其有效，偏航角速率控制（:ref:`YAW_RATE_ENABLE<YAW_RATE_ENABLE>`）必须设置为「1」，并使用"
" :ref:`Autotune <automatic-tuning-with-autotune>` 调好偏航角速率控制器以获得最佳性能。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:82 7ffe4e36f791436c8f98240ec5c79027
msgid "ACRO Mode YAW Rate Control"
msgstr "ACRO 模式偏航角速率控制"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:84 9a86b97b06ef455e9cd71c2999fa80ed
msgid ""
"As of version 4.2, ArduPilot provides the option for utilization of a rate "
"controller for YAW, which behaves in the same manner as the pitch and roll "
"controllers, explained above, but for the YAW axis controlled by the Rudder "
"stick, assuming the vehicle has a rudder control surface."
msgstr ""
"自 4.2 版本起，ArduPilot "
"提供了对偏航轴使用角速率控制器的选项，其行为方式与上述俯仰和横滚控制器相同，但作用于由方向舵摇杆控制的偏航轴（前提是飞机具有方向舵控制面）。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:86 dfd02b8aefb546bf9c71102a5219ee56
msgid ""
"To enable this functionality, set :ref:`YAW_RATE_ENABLE<YAW_RATE_ENABLE>` to"
" 1. When enabled, the :ref:`ACRO_YAW_RATE<ACRO_YAW_RATE>` parameter can be "
"used to adjust maximum yaw rate demanded at rudder stick full deflections in"
" ACRO mode."
msgstr ""
"要启用此功能，请将 :ref:`YAW_RATE_ENABLE<YAW_RATE_ENABLE>` 设置为 "
"1。启用后，:ref:`ACRO_YAW_RATE<ACRO_YAW_RATE>` 参数可用于调整 ACRO "
"模式下方向舵摇杆满偏时要求的最大偏航角速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:88 3626eee384d24759b09f4db74a8a470f
msgid ""
"Before use, the controller should be tuned, either manually or using "
"AutoTune. See :ref:`automatic-tuning-with-autotune` or the YAW tuning "
"section of the :ref:`Manual Tuning page<new-roll-and-pitch-tuning>`."
msgstr ""
"使用前，应通过手动或 AutoTune 对控制器进行调参。请参阅 :ref:`automatic-tuning-with-autotune` 或 "
":ref:`手动调参页面<new-roll-and-pitch-tuning>` 中的偏航调参章节。"

#: ../../source/docs/acro-mode.rst:90 fc58a0a2a08b4fa483b38ff565de64c0
msgid ""
"using this controller will give the feel of a 'heading hold' yaw axis. While"
" not exactly \"heading\" holding, it does resist any yaw rate change not "
"commanded by the pilot. This means the pilot will need to \"fly the tail\" "
"in turns. Just banking will not generate a clean turn."
msgstr ""
"使用此控制器会产生「航向保持」式偏航轴的操控感受。虽然并非严格意义上的「航向」保持，但它确实能抵抗任何非飞手指令的偏航角速率变化。这意味着飞手在转弯时需要「飞动尾部」——仅靠坡度无法完成干净的转弯。"
